# Tests and evidence

- Core tests stay headless (`tests/SteelConveyorWar.Core.Tests` must not reference SFML).
- SFML-specific assertions live in `tests/SteelConveyorWar.Sfml.Tests`.
- Prefer focused regression tests for new simulation behavior.
- Record commands run and results in the PR (build/test/smoke, coverage/TRX when produced).
- Known gaps belong in `docs/engineering/VERIFICATION_GAPS.md`, not silent omissions.
